        "art": "Jingshan Park: the highly recognizable Wanchun Pavilion, a square imperial pavilion with THREE stacked yellow-glazed pyramidal roof tiers, vivid red columns, dark-green brackets, white stone terrace on a small wooded hill. Steps lead toward the pavilion. View from slightly above and from the front, clear three-tier silhouette. Sparse ginkgo gold on the slope. Do not substitute the circular Temple of Heaven."
